**Sequencer to driver handshake**
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant S as sequence
  participant Q as sequencer
  participant D as driver
  S->>Q: start_item(req) - wait for grant
  D->>Q: get_next_item(req) - blocks
  Q-->>S: granted
  S->>S: randomize req (late randomization)
  S->>Q: finish_item(req)
  Q-->>D: req delivered
  D->>D: drive pins until protocol done
  D->>Q: item_done()
  Q-->>S: finish_item returns
```

### Solution
```systemverilog
class item_t extends uvm_sequence_item;
  rand bit [31:0] addr, data;
  rand bit        we;
  `uvm_object_utils(item_t)
  function new(string name = "item_t"); super.new(name); endfunction
endclass

class my_agent extends uvm_agent;
  `uvm_component_utils(my_agent)
  uvm_sequencer #(item_t) sqr;
  my_driver  drv;
  my_monitor mon;
  function new(string name, uvm_component parent); super.new(name, parent); endfunction
  function void build_phase(uvm_phase phase);
