### Code
```systemverilog
interface apb_if(input logic pclk, input logic presetn);
  timeunit 1ns; timeprecision 1ps;
  logic        psel, penable, pwrite;
  logic [31:0] paddr, pwdata, prdata;
  logic [3:0]  pstrb;
  logic [2:0]  pprot;
  logic        pready, pslverr;

  clocking drv_cb @(negedge pclk);
    default input #1step output #0;
    input  presetn;
    output psel, penable, pwrite, paddr, pwdata, pstrb, pprot;
  endclocking

  clocking mon_cb @(posedge pclk);
    default input #1step;
    input presetn, psel, penable, pwrite, paddr, pwdata;
    input pstrb, pprot, pready, prdata, pslverr;
  endclocking

  // Setup is followed by access with stable request
  ap_setup: assert property (@(posedge pclk) disable iff (presetn !== 1'b1)
    psel && !penable |=> psel && penable &&
      $stable({paddr, pwrite, pwdata, pstrb, pprot}));
  // Wait state keeps everything stable
  ap_wait: assert property (@(posedge pclk) disable iff (presetn !== 1'b1)
    psel && penable && !pready |=> psel && penable &&
      $stable({paddr, pwrite, pwdata, pstrb, pprot}));
  // Completion ends the access phase
  ap_end: assert property (@(posedge pclk) disable iff (presetn !== 1'b1)
    psel && penable && pready |=> !penable);
  // Reads use no strobes (APB4)
  ap_read_strobes: assert property (@(posedge pclk) disable iff (presetn !== 1'b1)
    psel && !pwrite |-> pstrb == 4'b0);
  // Prove the checks were exercised
  cp_wait: cover property (@(posedge pclk) disable iff (presetn !== 1'b1)
    psel && penable && !pready ##1 pready);
endinterface
```

### What a full checker adds
- Access must always be preceded by setup (`$rose(penable) |-> $past(psel && !penable)`).
- X checks on control signals, address-range and error expectations, reset properties.
- `cover property` per check so you can prove each one fired.

### Corner cases & pitfalls
- PADDR changing during a stalled access: `ap_wait` fires.
- A monitor that collects on PREADY alone counts idle cycles, because PREADY may be high while PSEL is low.
- Driving signals directly (`vif.psel = 1`) bypasses the clocking block and reintroduces races.

