### Rules to quote
- `vseq.start(null)` is legal because a virtual sequence never sends items itself; a sequence that calls `start_item` with no sequencer fails.
- Virtual sequencer pattern: store child sequencer handles in a component, assign in `connect_phase`, reach them via `p_sequencer` after `` `uvm_declare_p_sequencer ``.
