- Several item types: parameterize sequencer/driver with a common base class and `$cast` in the driver.

### Corner cases & pitfalls
- Never start the same sequence object twice concurrently.
- Two concurrent writers to the same address need an ordering-aware model or disjoint address ranges.
- A reset-stress sequence must accept `APB_RESET`, decide whether to retry, and rewrite memory before reading back.
- The test, not the sequence, owns the objection in this template; "stimulus finished" is not "verification finished".

