| call | `last_was_write` before | constraint | `write` result | `last_was_write` after |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | 0 | `write != 0` | 1 | 1 |
| 2 | 1 | `write != 1` | 0 | 0 |
| 3 | 0 | `write != 0` | 1 | 1 |

