**Key idea:** To check pulse width, period, duty cycle, or jitter, timestamp the relevant edges with `$realtime` and compare the elapsed time with the bound. Counting clock cycles cannot see a glitch shorter than a cycle. Same-direction edges give the period; opposite edges give high or low time.

