- `:=` assigns the weight to each value, `:/` divides it across the range — mixing them up skews results massively.
- Overflow in `(len+1) << size` if computed in 8 bits — cast to 32.
- Don't put scenario `dist` in the base item; tests can't remove it without `constraint_mode`.

