| Option | Array size | Each count | Consistent? |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| As stated | 300 | 40 | **No** (240 ≠ 300) |
| Fix size | 240 | 40 | yes |
| Fix count | 300 | 50 | yes |
| Extra values | 300 | 40 for 0–5, 60 slots for other values | yes, needs those values defined |

